{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/QuickStart","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Recognise the enrolled user and reject everyone else, in a few lines."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Getting-started","title":"Getting started","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yeofr\/quickstart"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yeofr\/quickstart"]}],"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"1-Add-the-SDK","text":"1. Add the SDK"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"YEOFR","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Swift package"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/yeo-messaging\/YEOFR-SPM"},{"type":"text","text":") to your project, pinned to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exact version "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"0.11.0","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import YEOFR"},{"type":"text","text":". The binary ships device"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arm64"},{"type":"text","text":") and Apple-silicon simulator ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arm64"},{"type":"text","text":") slices, so an app and its tests"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"build either way — but recognition needs a real device and stays inert on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"simulator."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"2-Pilot-unlock-for-non-YEO-bundle-IDs","text":"2. Pilot unlock for non-YEO bundle IDs"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YEOFR is gated to YEO-owned apps by default; a non-YEO bundle id aborts on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"construction. Evaluation customers get a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"temporary unlock code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bypasses the gate during a fixed pilot window — email"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"christo@yeomessaging.com"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to request one. Pass it to the initializer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(step 3). YEO-owned apps pass the gate natively."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"3-Drive-everything-with-FaceTrustService","text":"3. Drive everything with `FaceTrustService`"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService"},{"type":"text","text":" is the turnkey entry point. It owns the engine, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"camera, the fused-trust pipeline (face recognition + liveness CNN +"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TrueDepth), the identity gate, and tracker persistence, and exposes two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"streams: one for live trust verdicts and one for guided enrolment."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import YEOFR","","let service = FaceTrustService(pilotUnlockCode: \"YOUR-PILOT-CODE\")","","\/\/ Attach the preview to an AVCaptureVideoPreviewLayer:","\/\/   previewLayer.session = service.previewSession","","try await service.start()    \/\/ warm-up, restore enrolment, arm gate, start camera"]},{"type":"aside","style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"start()"},{"type":"text","text":" owns engine warm-up, and there is no public API to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"trigger it yourself. This is deliberate — warm-up must complete before the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first template is extracted, and an engine that is only half-warm answers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enrolment with a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"mismatched embedding"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rather than an error. Awaiting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"start()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" before you enrol or match is the whole contract."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Important"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"4-Enrol-a-face","level":2,"text":"4. Enrol a face"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enroll(name:)"},{"type":"text","text":" captures the next frame holding a single face, persists the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gallery, and re-arms the identity gate. Iterate the returned stream to coach"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the user:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["for await step in service.enroll(name: \"Alice\") {","    switch step.phase {","    case .capturing: show(step.prompt)","    case .completed: dismiss()","    case .failed:    show(step.prompt)","    @unknown default: break","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One capture is enough to separate the enrolled user from other people. Call"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it again under other angles\/lighting to improve recall — each capture adds a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sample to the same identity, up to 25 samples; captures after the 25th"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"report success but are not kept."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enroll(name:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is a quick start. The full enrolment is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment"},{"type":"text","text":", a guided five-pose walk your app drives from its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own camera loop."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"or-enrol-from-photos-you-already-have","text":"…or enrol from photos you already have"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No camera needed. Hand the SDK your reference images — a KYC set of three,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or thirty — and every usable one becomes a sample of the same identity:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let codes = await service.enroll(name: \"Alice\", images: kycPhotos)","let rejected = codes.enumerated().filter { $0.element != .OK }   \/\/ e.g. .imageNoFaceDetected"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Codes are index-aligned with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"images"},{"type":"text","text":", so a partly-usable set tells you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exactly which photos landed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"5. Run live recognition","type":"heading","anchor":"5-Run-live-recognition"},{"code":["for await update in service.updates() {","    switch update.status {","    case .trusted:    badge(\"TRUSTED — \\(update.matchedName ?? \"\")\", .green)","    case .notTrusted: badge(\"NOT TRUSTED\", .red)","    case .badFraming: badge(\"ADJUST FRAMING\", .orange)","    case .noFace:     badge(\"NO FACE\", .gray)","    @unknown default: break","    }","    \/\/ update.livenessGenuine \/ update.depthIsThreeD are the contributing signals.","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"update.status == .trusted"},{"type":"text","text":" already fuses face recognition, liveness, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TrueDepth, with framing applied — you never pick a similarity threshold,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"and you never touch the identity gate (forgetting it would collapse trust","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to liveness + depth, so any live face would pass). The enrolled gallery is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"saved across launches automatically; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"service.enrolledName"},{"text":" reflects who is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enrolled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"See-also","type":"heading","text":"See also","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A complete, runnable SwiftUI app lives in the package’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"Examples\/FRPilot","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — full API.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustUpdate"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/EnrollmentProgress"},{"text":" — the stream payloads.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR"]]},"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"YEOFR"}],"title":"QuickStart"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.yeomessaging.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/FaceTrustService/enroll(name:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enroll","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"name","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnrollmentProgress","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:5YEOFR18EnrollmentProgressV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Enrol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"name"},{"type":"text","text":" from the live camera and return a stream of capture"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"progress. The existing frame loop captures the next frame holding a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"single face; the service then persists the gallery, refreshes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enrolledName"},{"type":"text","text":", resets the trust pipeline against the fresh gallery, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-arms the identity gate — the consumer does none of that."}],"url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/facetrustservice\/enroll(name:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"enroll(name:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService\/enroll(name:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://com.yeomessaging.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/FaceTrustService":{"abstract":[{"text":"Turnkey entry point for on-device face recognition with fused liveness","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and TrueDepth anti-spoofing.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FaceTrustService","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService","url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/facetrustservice","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FaceTrustService","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"FaceTrustService"},"doc://com.yeomessaging.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/EnrollmentProgress":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnrollmentProgress","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Progress for an in-flight enrolment capture. Yielded by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService\/enroll(name:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and the stream finishes once the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gallery is banked (or the capture can’t start)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/enrollmentprogress","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EnrollmentProgress","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"EnrollmentProgress","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/EnrollmentProgress","role":"symbol"},"doc://com.yeomessaging.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/FaceTrustUpdate":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FaceTrustUpdate","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One per-frame trust readout, with the framing gate already applied — so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consumer renders a state, not a fusion of raw signals. Yielded by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService\/updates()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/facetrustupdate","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FaceTrustUpdate","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"FaceTrustUpdate","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustUpdate","role":"symbol"},"doc://com.yeomessaging.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/PoseWalkEnrollment":{"role":"symbol","title":"PoseWalkEnrollment","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PoseWalkEnrollment","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/posewalkenrollment","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The guided enrolment recipe: a walk through five head poses that fills"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the identity’s 25-sample foundation slot."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PoseWalkEnrollment","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://com.yeomessaging.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/FaceTrustService/updates()":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"updates","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5YEOFR15FaceTrustUpdateV","text":"FaceTrustUpdate","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Per-frame trust verdicts for the recognition UI. Call once and iterate;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the stream finishes on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stop()"},{"type":"text","text":". Newest-wins (the underlying camera"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream drops stale frames), so a slow consumer can’t back up memory."}],"url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/facetrustservice\/updates()","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"updates()","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService\/updates()","role":"symbol"},"doc://com.yeomessaging.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR","abstract":[{"text":"On-device face recognition with fused liveness and TrueDepth anti-spoofing.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","title":"YEOFR","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/yeofr"}},"variantOverrides":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"patch":[{"value":"occ","path":"\/identifier\/interfaceLanguage","op":"replace"},{"value":null,"path":"\/